  "contentHtml": "<P>아래의 글은 </P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>경상대학교 물리교육과 </P>\r\n<P>손정우 교수님께서 하셨던 수업입니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>중고등학교에서도 충분히 활용가능해서, </P>\r\n<P>교수님의 허락을 받고 올립니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>좋은 아이디어 공유해주셔서 감사합니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>---------------------------------------------------------</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>대학 캠퍼스 내를 돌아다니다 보면, <BR><BR>많은 나무들 앞에는 가끔 표지판(식물 표찰)이 있다. <BR><BR>몇년 되었으며, 어디서 왔으며, 누가 기증했는 지 등....<BR>또 생물학적 내용을 포함해서..<BR><BR>왜 물리는 없을까?<BR><BR>이런 생각을 실천에 옮기기 위해, 대학생들에게 과제를 내었다. <BR><BR>학교 내 물리와 관련된 상황을 찾고 이를 표지판으로 만들어 가능성에 대해 조사 해보라고...<BR><BR>그 결과 학생들은 다음과 같은 결과들을 제시하였다. <BR><BR>이런 활동을 중고생들과 함께 하는 것도 재미있을 것 같다. <BR><BR><IMG style=\"WIDTH: 714px; HEIGHT: 480px; CURSOR: pointer\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Ftes.or.kr%2Fbbs%2Fdata%2Fboard%2Ftesblog%2Ffile_in_body%2F1%2Fbbe7babb_rpeks.jpg\" width=800 height=462> <BR><IMG style=\"CURSOR: pointer\" border=0 src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Ftes.or.kr%2Fbbs%2Fdata%2Fboard%2Ftesblog%2Ffile_in_body%2F1%2Fbbe7babb_gbwl.jpg\"> <BR><BR></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0in; unicode-bidi: embed; DIRECTION: ltr; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0.12in; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: #39639d; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 7; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: accent4; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #39639D; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">당길 때는 적당한 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: #39639d; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 7; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: accent4; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #39639D; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">힘조절</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: #39639d; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 7; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: accent4; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #39639D; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\"> 필수</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: #39639d; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 7; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: accent4; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #39639D; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">!!</SPAN><BR>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0in; unicode-bidi: embed; DIRECTION: ltr; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0.12in; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging\"><BR>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0in; unicode-bidi: embed; DIRECTION: ltr; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0.12in; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">평상시 휴지는 풀리지 않고 잘 매달려있죠</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">그 이유는 두루마리 휴지 끝을 내릴만한 힘은 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">오직 중력 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">인데 이때 휴지와 휴지받침대의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">최대정지</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">마찰력보다 중력이 작아서 가만히 있지요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">!!</SPAN><BR>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0in; unicode-bidi: embed; DIRECTION: ltr; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0.12in; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">휴지를 사용하려고 풀려면 두꺼운 원통과 휴지 받침대와의 마찰력보다 큰 힘이 작용해야 풀리는 거랍니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">! </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">근데 여기서 너무 큰 힘으로 잡아당기면 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">안되요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">~</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">낭비가 되니까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">!</SPAN><BR>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0in; unicode-bidi: embed; DIRECTION: ltr; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0.12in; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging\"><BR>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0in; unicode-bidi: embed; DIRECTION: ltr; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0.12in; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: #39639d; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 7; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: accent4; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #39639D; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">휴지는 왜 두 층으로 겹쳐 있을까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: #39639d; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 7; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: accent4; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #39639D; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">?</SPAN><BR>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0in; unicode-bidi: embed; DIRECTION: ltr; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0.12in; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">화장지가 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">두 층이면 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">그 사이에 공기가 들어있어 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">완충작용</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">을 하므로 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">한 층을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">사용할 때 보다 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%\">촉감이 좋기 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY나무L; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: HY나무L; mso-fareast-font-family: HY나무L